PenGPTSwift is an independent Swift port of PenGPT by Sam Greydanus and
the PenGPT contributors.

Upstream project: https://github.com/greydanus/pengpt
Source revision: 3637f5c29989cd511bc3af90e3af1d2cbcdcb3e5

The Swift runtime, model reader, and tests adapt code and fixtures from
the upstream Apache License 2.0 project. See LICENSE.

The optional sketch text encoder uses weights derived from TinyCLIP
(wkcn/TinyCLIP-ViT-39M-16-Text-19M-YFCC15M), identified as MIT by its
publisher. Model weights are downloaded from the upstream PenGPT release.
https://huggingface.co/wkcn/TinyCLIP-ViT-39M-16-Text-19M-YFCC15M
